Package: gnomos
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: gnome-shell-extension-gnomos-volume
Description: Sonos client for GNOME
 Gnomos controls Sonos speakers from the GNOME desktop: browse and play
 music, manage the queue, groups, alarms and speaker settings.

Package: gnome-shell-extension-gnomos-volume
Architecture: all
Depends: gnome-shell (>= 45), ${misc:Depends}
Description: Quick Settings volume control for Gnomos
 GNOME Shell extension that adds Sonos room volume sliders to Quick
 Settings. Works together with the Gnomos application.
